		{"id":"7c719953909841da","type":"text","text":"### Metadata on ELK\n\n```json\n{\n  \"storage_id\": \"grp_001\",\n  \"storage_name\": \"client_001_batch_01\",\n  \"elasticsearch\": {\n    \"hosts\": [\"http://10.0.0.10:9200\"]\n  },\n\n  \"ingestion\": {\n    \"tool\": \"logstash\"\n  },\n\n  \"input_location\": {\n    \"storage_provider\": \"minio\",\n    \"container\": \"datalake\",\n    \"base_path\": \"client_001/source_001/\",\n    \"endpoint\": \"http://minio.company.local:9000\"\n  },\n\n  \"indexes\": [\n    {\n      \"dataset_id\": \"dataset_001\",\n      \"dataset_name\":\"employees\",\n      \"index_name\": \"employees\",\n      \"input_uri\": \"s3://datalake/client_001/source_001/employees.csv\",\n      \"status\": \"active\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"dataset_id\": \"dataset_002\",\n    \"dataset_name\":\"departments\",\n      \"index_name\": \"departments\",\n      \"input_uri\": \"s3://datalake/client_001/source_001/departments.csv\",\n      \"status\": \"active\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"dataset_id\": \"dataset_003\",\n      \"dataset_name\":\"orders\",\n      \"index_name\": \"orders\",\n      \"input_uri\": \"s3://datalake/client_001/source_001/orders.csv\",\n      \"status\": \"active\"\n    }\n  ],\n\n  \"status\": \"active\"\n}\n \n```","x":-1520,"y":-300,"width":800,"height":1240}
